#: kmfilterdlg.cpp:82
msgid " <qt><p>Check this button to force the confirmation dialog to show up.</ p><p>This is useful if you have defined a ruleset that tags messages to be downloaded later. Without the possibility to force the dialog popup, these messages could never be downloaded if no other large messages were waiting on the server, or if you wanted to change the ruleset to tag the messages differently.</p></qt>"
